### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Projekt erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ML Healthcare Projekt",
  "domain": "Healthcare"
}

### 3. Projekt abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### 4. Business Understanding
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/business-understanding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessGoal": "ML-basierte Patientenrisiko-Vorhersage",
  "teamSize": 5,
  "timelineValue": 12,
  "timelineUnit": "WEEKS",
  "estimatedCost": 75000,
  "projectTeamRoles": ["DATA_SCIENTIST", "ML_ENGINEER"],
  "toolsBusinessUnderstanding": "Jira"
}

### 5. Data Characteristics
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/data-characteristics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dataAvailability": true,
  "dataSources": ["EHR System", "Lab DB"],
  "dataSecurityConstraints": "GDPR",
  "velocity": "BATCH",
  "veracity": "MEDIUM",
  "variety": "LOW",
  "volumeValue": 500000,
  "volumeUnit": "RECORDS",
  "variability": "SOMETIMES",
  "dataAccess": ["INTERNAL"],
  "dataPreparationSteps": "JOINS",
  "toolsData": "PostgreSQL"
}

### 6. Analysis Config
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/analysis-config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeOfAnalytics": "CLASSIFICATION",
  "dataScienceGoals": "Risiko-Score für Patienten",
  "evaluationMetrics": ["Accuracy", "Precision"],
  "toolsAnalysis": "Python, scikit-learn"
}

### 7. 🎯 WIZARD ABSCHLIESSEN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/complete-wizard

### 8. Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/1

### 9. Timeline
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/1/timeline